Output docs/demo/agent.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 470
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' PATH="$PWD/target/release:$PATH"` Enter
Type `clear; printf '$ reflex demo agent\n'; REFLEX_DEMO_FAST=1 reflex demo agent` Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 4s
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Type "reflex demo agent"
Show
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Sleep 5s
